OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed councillor 'protecting    
OL,4,Astaff member during street clean'      
OL,6,FA councillor was trying to protect a   
OL,7,Fmember of council staff when he was    
OL,8,Fstabbed while doing community work in  
OL,9,Fhis ward, his family has said.         
OL,11,FCouncillor Ibrar Ali remains in        
OL,12,Fhospital in a stable condition after he
OL,13,Fwas attacked at about 11:04 GMT on     
OL,14,FThursday on Thornbury Avenue, before   
OL,15,Fbeing driven to nearby Manse Street,   
OL,16,Faccording to police.                   
OL,18,FA 32-year-old man was arrested on      
OL,19,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a  
OL,20,Fstand-off on the roof of a home on     
OL,21,FThornbury Avenue that lasted more than 
OL,22,Fthree hours. He remains in custody.    
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
